== 6. Theorem B3.3(d): constants of the a priori SGD versions ==
   lambda_sigma = max_g m_g/(2 sigma_g^2) = 400
   n = 2048, eps = 0.1: KL <= eps n needs t <= 1.02 (a: flow), <= 0.256 (d: mixture, noise term ignored), <= 0.00256 (d: Markov, delta' = 0.01); at eta = 0.2 that is 5.1, 1.28, 0.0128 steps
   n = 16384, eps = 0.1: KL <= eps n needs t <= 8.19 (a: flow), <= 2.048 (d: mixture, noise term ignored), <= 0.02048 (d: Markov, delta' = 0.01); at eta = 0.2 that is 41.0, 10.24, 0.1024 steps

